# --- Emergent Support (ticket 255734): workspace auto-commit unblock ---
# The platform stages with :(exclude)<path> pathspecs. git aborts the ENTIRE
# staging step if .gitignore also ignores a path named that way, so the
# end-of-turn commit never runs and Save to GitHub has nothing to push.
# Un-ignoring the ENTRY stops the collision; the /** lines keep all CONTENTS
# ignored, so no env file and no build output is ever committed.
# Keep this block LAST in the file.
!/.env
!/build
/build/**
!/.next
/.next/**
.next/dev/cache/turbopack/411c455d/00025829.sst
